## Signature (Cosign / GPG)

**Sign this document after filling in all fields:**

```sh
# GPG signature
gpg --armor --detach-sign docs/governance/validation-evidence-<RUN-DATE>.md

# OR cosign blob signature (keyless OIDC)
cosign sign-blob docs/governance/validation-evidence-<RUN-DATE>.md \
  --bundle docs/governance/validation-evidence-<RUN-DATE>.md.bundle
```

