## Retention Policy

Retain this document per `docs/METHOD/EVIDENCE_RETENTION.md` (ADR-091):

- **Local mode:** keep last 5 runs under `.evidence/` (gitignored)
- **External mode:** upload to configured bucket; local copy pruned after upload
- **Minimum retention:** 2 years (regulated contexts requiring §11.10 compliance)

Run `node scripts/evidence-rotate.mjs` after archiving to enforce the rotation policy.

